{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1742830334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About this game</strong><br>Dive into a dystopian future with <i>Heart: Future Whispers</i>, a top-down shooter that will push your skills to the limit. Investigate the vision of Mystra, where all bonds have been shattered, and uncover who is behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1742830334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaos Discovery</strong><br>Face hordes of enemies that attack periodically, testing your tactics and reflexes. Utilize a variety of weapons to survive intense battles and unveil the dark secrets that threaten the world's existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1742830334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong><br>By eliminating enemies, accumulate money that can be used to acquire unique weapons. Carefully manage your resources to buy the most powerful weapons, prolong your survival, and face increasingly greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441350/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1742830334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong><br>In infinite mode, survive as many waves as possible and see who can score the most points. The difficulty constantly increases\u2014who will set the high score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to face humanity\u2019s greatest threat. Are you ready for the battle?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Runner Eradicator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/